# GBIF-derived species data and its OpenStreetMap-derived place-search sibling —
# large (seasonal_cells.bolt: ~1.2 GB; places.bolt: tens to hundreds of MB),
# rebuilt by cmd/gensnapshot areas/places, never committed: scp'd
# directly to the serving host instead. See ARCHITECTURE.md. Unlike these,
# data/taxonomy_*.json.gz stays small and IS committed (go:embed'd into the
# binary) — don't broaden this pattern to /data/ wholesale.
/data/hotspots.bolt
/data/hotspots_seasonal.bolt
/data/seasonal_cells.bolt
/data/places.bolt
